# Applies to every image built from this repo (context: . in docker-compose.yml).
# Without this, COPY apps/*/. into a build stage drags in host-machine
# artifacts — including a stale tsconfig.tsbuildinfo, which makes nest
# build silently skip emitting dist/ (it did, once) — and secrets like .env.

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/coverage

**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

apps/api/uploads/*
!apps/api/uploads/.gitkeep

.git
.claude
